From 70c64b06527a54e46081b325887c8b27f88dc371 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HuaWen CHEN <huawenc@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 17:37:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Port: modemmanager add support address reconfig

Port of sdx85 change eaccf1367876a844d49f3340209e1c68dff8156b
(0010-modemmanager-add-support-address-reconfig.patch).

Adds bearer reconfiguration system: when QMI WDS extended IP config
indication fires (DNS/MTU/domain-name change) or packet-service-status
indicates reconfiguration_required==TRUE while connected, MM queries
current settings and updates D-Bus ip4/ip6_config properties live
without disconnecting the bearer.

Key additions:
- mm_base_bearer_update_ip_config() to push new IP config to D-Bus
- ReconfigurationContext + RECONFIG_STEP state machine in mm-bearer-qmi
- ipv4/ipv6_reconfiguration_ongoing guard flags to prevent re-entrancy
- packet_service_status_indication_cb restructured as switch to handle
  CONNECTED+reconfiguration_required case alongside DISCONNECTED

Change-Id: I2f49ab3266108b7d5e0482f86dd00a9ed1d43752

Signed-off-by: HuaWen CHEN <huawenc@qti.qualcomm.com>
